                        "player": "Sure, but why are you here specifically?"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Why does anyone go anywhere? As a gatherer of people, I go where people gather. The Grand Exchange is known to be a place where people come together. What better place to bring them even closer?"
                      },
                      {
                        "player": "I suppose this usually is a crowded place."
                      },
